arson p value             | 0.19 0.007064  | -0.07 0.346    | 0.39 2.301e-07 | 0.36 2.24e-07  | 0.04 0.5378  |                |\n| Zn      | Bonferroni Adjusted p value | 0.02119200     | 0.69200000     | 0.00000112     | 0.00000112     | 0.69200000   |                |\n\n27\n\n28\n\n29",
